~ convo_1
Az: So, like, what are your powers exactly?
Winston: I controleth ice makers! I createth magical things! Can't exactly... controleth... my creations, though.
Az: Wait- this is a stretch- do you Palina Glover? Ice Wizard? Owner of Enginice?
Winston: Ugh. Doth not remind me of mine own Mother's name.
Az: Mother?! She's your MOM?! No way!
Winston: What?! Why art thee star stricken?
Az: No WAY! I've been obsessed with Enginice since I was a kid! I used to tinker with all their devices all the time.
Az: One time, I transformed the fridge into a fully functional oven. Baba came home to burnt steaks and soggy vegetables. It was awesome.
Winston: Oh my! That is so cool. Tis not quite the sameth, but I once made snowmen in mine own basement using Mother's laundry device.
Az: What?? You have to tell me how you did that.
Winston: Haha! Why, of course!
do EventFlags.set_flag("F-1-AzWs-GreatHall", true)
=> END

~ convo_2
Winston: Az?
Az: Yeah, 'sup?
Winston: I wanteth to apologize to thee once more.
Az: Hey, look. We're good. You may have tried to kill us, but you saved me, and you helped me get closer to freeing my Baba
Winston: But I feeleth t'rrible. I gaveth thee thy inhaler, but I madeth thee breatheth fire when I kneweth about thy asthma
Az: You didn't make me do anything. I lost my cool. You're good, dude.
Winston: Well... alright.
do EventFlags.set_flag("F-2-AzWs-GreatHall", true)
=> END

~ convo_3
Fenn: Hey guys!
Az: Hey kid. Thanks for the help in the Cellar. Couldn't have done it without you.
Fenn: Well I couldn't have done much without your bangles, either...
Winston: Sorry for, like, trying to killeth thee, and stuff.
Fenn: It wouldn't be an adventure without any danger!
Az: Winston, you're good. Don't worry about it.
do EventFlags.set_flag("F-3-AzWs-GreatHall", true)
=> END

~ convo_4
Winston: May I taketh a look at thy bangles?
Az: Yeah sure.
Winston: Whoa... this is incredible!
Az: It's really nothing special.
Winston: Nay, seriously! Thy patterns art so intricate and clean. They hardly look handmade.
Winston: This must hath taken thee months!
Az: It was a few weeks, yeah...
Winston: Weeks?! Whoa. 
do EventFlags.set_flag("F-4-AzWs-GreatHall", true)
=> END

~ convo_5
Az: Hey, Winston. I want to ask you something.
Winston: What is on thy mind?
Az: The picture frame? In my workshop?
Winston: NAY! Didst I break it? I'm sorry!
Az: No! No, actually. The opposite. I thought you smashed it. I saw it in one piece right before you made Iceton.
Winston: Oh... no. I couldn't bringeth myself to breaketh it. I did smash some ice and pretend like it hath broken
Winston: I'm sorry.
Az: Why are you apologizing? You didn't really do anything wrong.
Winston: Well... for scaring thee.
Az: Water under the bridge, man.
Winston: Alright. Thank you.
do EventFlags.set_flag("F-5-AzWs-GreatHall", true)
=> END

~ convo_6
Az: So, Winston... you make things with ice, right?
Winston: Aye, basically.
Az: So all those little creatures running through the cellar? The ice cubes? That was you?
Winston: Well, yeah...
Az: Seriously?! 
Winston: I hath many machines and molds to maketh them. If only they did listen to me.
Az: That's incredible dude. I wish blacksmithing was that cool.
Winston: Perhaps we couldst, like, work together sometime.
Az: Yeah? That'd be awesome! We could call it "ice-smithing" or something
Winston: Really??
Az: Yeah, it'd be cool.
Winston: Cool.
do EventFlags.set_flag("F-6-AzWs-GreatHall", true)
=> END

